A25. What three butchers with red hair are. ~ TRIO
A27. Musical (?) instruments. ~ OBOES
A29. This is found in all family trees. ~ SAP
A30. Something that's always getting sat on. ~ CHAIR
A31. A five-cent cigar and a famous cartoonist. ~ WEED
